<title>USA: VNU closes acquisition of Equifax unit.</title>
<headline>VNU closes acquisition of Equifax unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>VNU Marketing Information Services, a unit of Dutch publisher NV Verenigd Bezit VNU, on Tuesday said it completed the acquisition of Equifax Inc's National Decision Systems.</p>
<p>The acquisition is accompanied by a long-term strategic marketing and cross-licensing agreement linking the VNU unit and Equifax for the next 10 years.</p>
<p>The acquisition agreement was announced May 16.</p>
</text>
